    <string name="help_section_calendar_views">Calendar View</string>
    <string name="help_calendar_views_1">The application has two main views: Monthly and Annual. You can switch between them by tapping on the year in the header.</string>
    <string name="help_calendar_views_2">In the monthly view, swipe left or right to change months. The top-left arrow in the header will return to the current month.</string>
    <string name="help_section_event_management">Event Management</string>
    <string name="help_event_management_1">Tap on a day in the monthly calendar to see its events or add a new one. Events can also be created by tapping the (+) icon in the header.</string>
    <string name="help_event_management_2">Events (single or repeated) can be edited and deleted in any calendar that is editable.</string>
    <string name="help_section_event_list">Event List</string>
    <string name="help_event_list_1">Below the monthly calendar, the list of events for the month is displayed. For the current month, you can choose to view Pending or All events by tapping the Pending-All button. Each event in the list can be edited and deleted.</string>
    <string name="help_section_customization">Personalization</string>
    <string name="help_customization_1">From the Settings menu, you can choose Light and Dark mode. You can also customize the interface colors and Import and Export color themes to share them.</string>
    <string name="help_customization_2"></string>
    <string name="help_section_holiday_manager">Holiday Manager</string>
    <string name="help_holiday_manager_1">This feature allows you to manually mark specific days as holidays or working days, regardless of the system calendar or imported events. When a day is marked as a holiday, its number will be highlighted in the corresponding color in the monthly and yearly views.</string>
    <string name="help_section_widget">Widget</string>
    <string name="help_widget_1">The application includes a Widget for the Home screen that displays upcoming events. You can customize its appearance by choosing the number of events to display, changing the font size, and modifying its colors.</string>
